    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68d366cf0000000013029a70:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-7:u3",
      "position": 3,
      "source_unit_type": "narrative-summary",
      "text_projection": "✅基本信息\n1️⃣岗位：Java研发工程师 - 北京\n2️⃣时间线：2025-07-09投递 → 07-14收到面试邀请 → 07-15面试\n3️⃣个人背景：海本海硕，年底硕士毕业，计算机专业，外企实习+工作3年经验\n4️⃣技术栈（工作）：C# .NET、AWS云服务、Azure DevOps",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_json/68d366cf0000000013029a70.json@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "8c6b46380615f8a10412f9d87cdb7fe088d8f733a1d87308b4506851a36998ca",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68d366cf0000000013029a70.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "ba8229e89c6b4b87a8ab29938d26c1e6c346bdd9bd41cff8e4cdaccc71dbc8d6",
        "source_projection_item_number": 3
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68d366cf0000000013029a70:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-7:u4",
      "position": 4,
      "source_unit_type": "narrative-summary",
      "text_projection": "✅面试内容\n项目经历讨论，前公司项目深度交流\n1️⃣技术栈应用情况\n2️⃣AWS相关技术实现\n3️⃣微服务架构设计\n4️⃣扩容缩容机制\n5️⃣K8s扩容机制（承认不熟悉）\n6️⃣AWS服务间交互协议\n7️⃣Azure DevOps CI/CD流水线构建\n8️⃣并发问题解决方案\n9️⃣数据库优化策略",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_json/68d366cf0000000013029a70.json@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "8c6b46380615f8a10412f9d87cdb7fe088d8f733a1d87308b4506851a36998ca",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68d366cf0000000013029a70.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "ba8229e89c6b4b87a8ab29938d26c1e6c346bdd9bd41cff8e4cdaccc71dbc8d6",
        "source_projection_item_number": 4
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68d366cf0000000013029a70:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-7:u5",
      "position": 5,
      "source_unit_type": "narrative-summary",
      "text_projection": "✅学校项目：基于SpringBoot + React + PostgreSQL + RabbitMQ的分布式微服务项目，重点考察高可用、容错性、并发处理能力。\n1️⃣SpringBoot框架原理\n2️⃣SpringBoot事务机制基础\n3️⃣数据库事务与SpringBoot事务的区别\n4️⃣@Transactional注解在同类调用时的生效性\n5️⃣无接口继承情况下外部调用的事务生效性\n6️⃣SpringBoot自动装配机制\n7️⃣微服务拆分思路\n8️⃣商品模块与用户模块的独立性保证\n9️⃣跨模块数据访问处理方案\n🔟多节点部署的负载均衡策略\n1️⃣1️⃣数据库事务实现原理\n1️⃣2️⃣事务隔离级别\n1️⃣3️⃣事务隔离级别的实现机制",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_json/68d366cf0000000013029a70.json@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
